\n\nDot product:\n\n[ d s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] * [ d(1 + s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)) - c ] + [ -h - s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] * [ -s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] = 0\n\nLet me compute each term:\n\nFirst term:\n\nd s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) * [ d + d s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) - c ]\n\n= d s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) * [ (d - c) + d s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\nSecond term:\n\n[ -h - s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] * [ -s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\n= [ h + s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] * s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\n= h s h d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + s^2 h^2 d^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2\n\n= s h\u00b2 d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + s\u00b2 h\u00b2 d^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2\n\nNow, combining both terms:\n\nFirst term expanded:\n\nd s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) * (d - c) + d s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) * d s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\n= d s h\u00b2 (d - c)/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + d\u00b2 s\u00b2 h^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2\n\nSecond term is as above.\n\nSo total equation:\n\nd s h\u00b2 (d - c)/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + d\u00b2 s\u00b2 h^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 + s h\u00b2 d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + s\u00b2 h\u00b2 d^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 = 0\n\nCombine like terms:\n\nTerms with s:\n\n[ d s h\u00b2 (d - c)/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + s h\u00b2 d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] + terms with s\u00b2:\n\n[ d\u00b2 s\u00b2 h^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 + s\u00b2 h\u00b2 d^4/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 ] = 0\n\nFactor s from first bracket and s\u00b2 from second:\n\ns [ d h\u00b2 (d - c)/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + h\u00b2 d\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] + s\u00b2 [ d\u00b2 h^4 + h\u00b2 d^4 ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 ] = 0\n\nSimplify first bracket:\n\n= s [ d h\u00b2 (d - c) + h\u00b2 d\u00b2 ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\n= s [ d h\u00b2 (d - c + d ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\n= s [ d h\u00b2 (2d - c ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\nSecond bracket:\n\n= s\u00b2 [ d\u00b2 h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 ]\n\n= s\u00b2 [ d\u00b2 h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\nSo equation becomes:\n\ns [ d h\u00b2 (2d - c ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] + s\u00b2 [ d\u00b2 h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] = 0\n\nFactor out s d h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2):\n\ns d h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) [ (2d - c ) + s d ] = 0\n\nThus, solutions are:\n\nEither s = 0, which would give F = D, but AF would then be AD and CF would be CD, but angle at D is not necessarily right, so discard s=0.\n\nOr:\n\n(2d - c ) + s d = 0 \u21d2 s = (c - 2d)/d\n\nThus, s = (c/d) - 2\n\nTherefore, the parameter s is (c/d) - 2.\n\nNow, with this value of s, we can compute AF\u00b2 and CF\u00b2.\n\nFirst, compute AF\u00b2:\n\nFrom earlier, AF squared is:\n\n[ d s h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\u00b2 + [ -h - s h d\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\u00b2\n\nPlug in s = (c/d) - 2:\n\nFirst component:\n\nd * [ (c/d - 2) ] h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) = (c - 2d) h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\nSo squared: (c - 2d)^2 h^4 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2\n\nSecond component:\n\n-h - [ (c/d - 2) ] h d\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) = -h - (c d - 2d\u00b2) h / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\n= -h [ 1 + (c d - 2d\u00b2)/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\n= -h [ (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 + c d - 2d\u00b2 ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\n= -h [ (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\n\nThus, squared term:\n\nh\u00b2 (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d )\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2\n\nTherefore, AF\u00b2 = [ (c - 2d)^2 h^4 + h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d )\u00b2 ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2\n\nSimilarly, compute CF squared:\n\nFrom earlier, CF squared is:\n\n[ d(1 + s h\u00b2/(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)) - c ]\u00b2 + [ -s h d\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ]\u00b2\n\nPlug in s = (c/d - 2):\n\nFirst term inside the square:\n\nd [1 + (c/d - 2) h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] - c\n\n= d + (c - 2d) h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) - c\n\n= (d - c) + (c - 2d) h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\nFactor:\n\n= (d - c)(1 - 2 h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)) + (c - 2d) h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\nWait, no, better to compute directly:\n\n= d - c + (c - 2d) h\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)\n\n= [ (d - c)(h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) + (c - 2d) h\u00b2 ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 )\n\n= [ (d - c)h\u00b2 + (d - c)d\u00b2 + c h\u00b2 - 2d h\u00b2 ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 )\n\nSimplify numerator:\n\n= (d - c)h\u00b2 + (d - c)d\u00b2 + c h\u00b2 - 2d h\u00b2\n\n= [ (d - c)h\u00b2 + c h\u00b2 - 2d h\u00b2 ] + (d - c)d\u00b2\n\n= [ d h\u00b2 - c h\u00b2 + c h\u00b2 - 2d h\u00b2 ] + (d - c)d\u00b2\n\n= [ -d h\u00b2 ] + (d - c)d\u00b2\n\n= -d h\u00b2 + d\u00b3 - c d\u00b2\n\n= d\u00b3 - c d\u00b2 - d h\u00b2\n\n= d (d\u00b2 - c d - h\u00b2 )\n\nThus, first term squared:\n\n[ d (d\u00b2 - c d - h\u00b2 ) / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 ) ]\u00b2\n\nSecond term:\n\n[ -s h d\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] = [ - (c/d - 2 ) h d\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2) ] = [ (2d - c ) h d / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 ) ]\n\nSquared term:\n\n(2d - c )\u00b2 h\u00b2 d\u00b2 / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 )\u00b2\n\nTherefore, CF\u00b2 = [ d\u00b2 (d\u00b2 - c d - h\u00b2 )\u00b2 + (2d - c )\u00b2 h\u00b2 d\u00b2 ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 )\u00b2\n\nFactor out d\u00b2:\n\nCF\u00b2 = d\u00b2 [ (d\u00b2 - c d - h\u00b2 )\u00b2 + (2d - c )\u00b2 h\u00b2 ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 )\u00b2\n\nNow, to find AF\u00b2 / CF\u00b2:\n\n[ (c - 2d)^2 h^4 + h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d )\u00b2 ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2)^2 divided by [ d\u00b2 [ (d\u00b2 - c d - h\u00b2 )\u00b2 + (2d - c )\u00b2 h\u00b2 ] ] / (h\u00b2 + d\u00b2 )\u00b2\n\nThe denominators cancel out, so:\n\nAF\u00b2 / CF\u00b2 = [ (c - 2d)^2 h^4 + h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d )\u00b2 ] / [ d\u00b2 [ (d\u00b2 - c d - h\u00b2 )\u00b2 + (2d - c )\u00b2 h\u00b2 ] ]\n\nThis looks complicated, but maybe the numerator and denominator can be simplified.\n\nLet me compute the numerator first:\n\nNumerator = (c - 2d)^2 h^4 + h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d )\u00b2\n\nFactor h\u00b2:\n\n= h\u00b2 [ (c - 2d)^2 h\u00b2 + (h\u00b2 - d\u00b2 + c d )\u00b2 ]\n\nSimilarly, denominator:\n\nDenominator = d\u00b2 [ (d\u00b2